{"unit_id": "tag:05JN:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n代数（algebra）一章的工作带来的一个结果是，可以如下定义局部投射（projective）模（module）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指前面一章的主题"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射", "context": "所定义的模的局部性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "此处将要定义的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:05JP:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是一个拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0003>-模（module）。称<MATH_0004>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>局部投射（locally projective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0005>，<MATH_0006>-模（module）<MATH_0007>都是投射（projective）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "locally projective", "target_term": "局部投射"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义的底空间"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "定义适用的模的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "定义所考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "locally projective", "target_term": "局部投射", "context": "此处定义的性质"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "局部条件的检验范围"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "在仿射开集上检验的对象"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射", "context": "仿射开集上要求的模性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:05JQ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是一个拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0003>-模（module）。以下条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004>是局部投射（projective）的；\n<STRUCT_0003> 存在一个仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>，使得<MATH_0006>-模（module）<MATH_0007>是投射（projective）的，对每个<MATH_0008>均如此。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n特别地，如果<MATH_0009>且<MATH_0010>，那么<MATH_0011>是局部投射（projective）的，当且仅当<MATH_0012>是投射（projective）<MATH_0013>-模（module）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理的底空间"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "引理所设的模的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "引理所考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "引理断言的条件关系"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射", "context": "第一个条件中的局部性质"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "覆盖的成员类型"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第二个条件中要求存在的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "覆盖条件所检验的对象"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射", "context": "覆盖条件中要求的模性质"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射", "context": "特别情形中左侧的局部性质"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射", "context": "特别情形中右侧的模性质"}, {"source_ter