{"unit_id": "tag:05JQ:proof", "translation": "首先注意，如果<MATH_0001>是投射（projective）<MATH_0002>-模（module），且<MATH_0003>是环同态（ring map），那么<MATH_0004>是投射（projective）<MATH_0005>-模（module），见《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>。\n因此，如果<MATH_0006>是一个仿射开集（affine open），且<MATH_0007>是投射（projective）<MATH_0008>-模（module），那么标准开集（standard open）<MATH_0009>是一个仿射开集（affine open），且<MATH_0010>是投射（projective）<MATH_0011>-模（module），对所有<MATH_0012>均如此。\n假设（2）成立。设<MATH_0013>是任意仿射开集（affine open）。我们可以找到一个开覆盖（covering）<MATH_0014>，由有限多个标准开集（standard opens）<MATH_0015>组成，使得对每个<MATH_0016>，开集（open）<MATH_0017>都是某个<MATH_0018>的标准开集（standard open），见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0002>。\n因此，若令<MATH_0019>，并且<MATH_0020>是一个<MATH_0021>-模（module），使得<MATH_0022>对应于<MATH_0023>，则可知<MATH_0024>是投射（projective）<MATH_0025>-模（module）。由此可知，<MATH_0026>是忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的环同态（ring map），且<MATH_0027>是投射（projective）<MATH_0028>-模（module）。因此，<MATH_0029>是投射（projective）的，依据是《代数（Algebra）》定理<REF_0003>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {