{"unit_id": "tag:060M:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个态射（morphism），其源和目标都是概形（schemes）。设<MATH_0002>是一个拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0003>-模（module）。如果<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>上是局部投射（projective）的，那么<MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>上也是局部投射（projective）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给定的概形之间的映射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源与目标"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "给定模的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "引理中假定的对象"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射", "context": "假设中的局部性质"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "投射", "context": "结论中的局部性质"}], "notes": []}
