{"unit_id": "tag:01PD:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n有时，能够证明开子概形（open subscheme）上给定的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）可以延拓到整个概形（scheme），是有用的。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "拟凝聚层最初所在的开子空间"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "需要证明可以延拓的对象"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "延拓所到达的整个空间"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01PE:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拟紧开（quasi-compact open）浸入（immersion），其源和目标都是概形（schemes）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>上的任意拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）都可以延拓为<MATH_0003>上的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 设<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>上的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。设<MATH_0006>是一个拟凝聚子层（quasi-coherent subsheaf）。存在一个拟凝聚子层（quasi-coherent subsheaf）<MATH_0007>，它包含于<MATH_0008>，使得<MATH_0009>，其中两边均视为<MATH_0010>的子层（subsheaves）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 设<MATH_0011>是<MATH_0012>上的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。设<MATH_0013>是<MATH_0014>上的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。设<MATH_0015>是一个态射（morphism），其源与目标均为<MATH_0016>-模（modules）。存在一个拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0017>，它是<MATH_0018>-模（modules）所成的层，以及一个映射（map）<MATH_0019>，使得<MATH_0020>且<MATH_0021>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent subsheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚子层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent subsheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚子层"}, {"source_term": "subsheaves", "target_term": "子层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开", "context": "限定引理中的浸入"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "引理中给定的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "浸入的源与目标"}