{"unit_id": "tag:01PE:proof", "translation": "浸入（immersion）是分离（separated）的（见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>），且由假设，<MATH_0001>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。因此，对任意拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0002>（在<MATH_0003>上），层（sheaf）<MATH_0004>是它到<MATH_0005>的延拓（extension）。见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0002>及《层（Sheaves）》节<REF_0003>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n设<MATH_0006>、<MATH_0007>如（2）中所述。则<MATH_0008>是<MATH_0009>上的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）（见上文）。它是<MATH_0010>的子层（subsheaf）。因此核（kernel）<MATH_0011>也是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的，见《概形（Schemes）》节<REF_0004>。可以形式地验证<MATH_0012>且<MATH_0013>（再次使用《层（Sheaves）》节<REF_0005>的内容）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n第（3）项的证明与第（2）项相同。只需取<MATH_0014>，连同它到<MATH_0015>的显然的映射（map），以及它与<MATH_0016>在<MATH_0017>上的显然的等同（identification）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "延拓"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "subsheaf", "target_term": "子层"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "由一般性质推出分离性时所用的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "浸入具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "分离性所引引理所在章名"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "由假设具备的性质"}, {"source_term": "qua