{"unit_id": "tag:01PD:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面的引理指出，拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的概形（scheme）上的每个拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）都是有限表示（finite presentation）的<MATH_0001>-模（modules）的滤过余极限（filtered colimit）。实际上，在再下一个引理中，我们用有向集（directed sets）上的有向（directed）余极限（colimits）来重述这一结论，这种表述也许更为熟悉。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "filtered colimit", "target_term": "滤过余极限"}, {"source_term": "directed sets", "target_term": "有向集"}, {"source_term": "directed", "target_term": "有向"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "底概形的第一项假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "底概形的第二项假设"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所讨论的拟凝聚层所在的空间"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "将表示为余极限的任意对象"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "参与构造余极限的模的有限性条件"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "参与构造余极限的对象"}, {"source_term": "filtered colimit", "target_term": "滤过余极限", "context": "下面引理对该层给出的构造"}, {"source_term": "directed sets", "target_term": "有向集", "context": "后一引理重述时使用的指标"}, {"source_term": "directed", "target_term": "有向", "context": "后一引理所得余极限的性质"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限", "context": "后一引理重述所用的构造"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01PJ:statement", "translation": "<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。假设<MATH_0002>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的。设<MATH_0003>是一个拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0004>-模（module）。存在\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 一个滤过（filtered）指标范畴（index category）<MATH_0005>（见《范畴（Categories）》定义<REF_0001>），\n<STRUCT_0003> 一个图表（diagram）<MATH_0006>（见《范畴（Categories）》节<REF_0002>），<MATH_0007>，\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0008>-模（modules）之间的态射（morphisms）\n<MATH_0009>\n<STRUCT_0005>\n使得每个<MATH_0010>都是有限表示（finite presentation）的，且态射（morphisms）<MATH_0011>诱导同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0012>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "filtered", "target_term": "滤过"}, {"source_term": "index category", "target_term": "指标范畴"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理给定的底空间"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "底概形的第一项假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "底概形的第二项假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "给定模的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "将表示为余极限的对象"}, {"source_term": "filtered", "target_term": "滤过", "context": "所构造的指标范畴的性质"}, {"source_term": "index category", "target_term": "指标范畴", "context": "为图表提供指标的范畴"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "所引定义所在章名"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "参与余极限构造的图表"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "所引章节的章名"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所列态射的源与目标"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理断言存在的态射"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "图表中各对象的有限性条件"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "诱导同构的一族态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "由上述态射诱导的结果"}], "notes": []}
